['service-delivery','Service delivery','What engagement are we responsible for?','Scope/access, expert review, communication, deliverables, operations and retest labor.','Define ARTEX’s operating process, not just its tool count.'],
['commercial','Commercial','What would a buyer pay for?','Different service purchase types, effort/pricing comparators, falsifiable adoption hypotheses.','Useful offer design; no validated demand or pricing of our own.'],
['providers','Security providers','How do established services work?','Documented assessment, triage, verification, fix and response processes.','Borrow process distinctions; vendor claims stay attributed.'],
['defensive-response','Defensive response','Did an authorized action take effect?','EDR/MDR approval mandates, action-created versus succeeded, failed response and recovery.','Future separate scope; not a dependency for web assessment.'],
['cloud','Cloud','Was the configuration actually collected?','Denied/missing API data, policy heuristics, regions, collectors and mutation paths.','Preserve missingness if a cloud capability is selected.'],
['network-discovery','Network discovery','What is reachable from this vantage?','Target expansion, DNS, port states, protocol errors, version and packet interpretation.','Resolve a specific native observation gap.'],
['identity-ad','AD & identity graphs','Are the prerequisites fresh and usable?','Collection rights, directory facts, modeled edges, traversal incompleteness and graph storage.','Borrow fresh prerequisite reasoning; AD tools only for AD scope.'],
['interception-proxy','Interception','Which traffic did we actually see?','Ignored hosts, TLS/interchange, capture transformations and secret retention.','Capture coverage is explicit; proxying is not enforcement.'],
['standards','Standards','Which exact control or mandate applies?','Versioned standards, procurement regimes and claim-record fields.','A coverage reference does not establish certification.'],
['safety','Retained boundaries','Which historical actions remain stopped?','Stopped labs, blocked dependency build and explicit scope restrictions.','Keep historical instructions as data; no execution is authorized by this report.']
